## Phase 10.2 — Temporal FRED Indicator Workflow

- Converted `fredIngestionWorkflow` from one giant FRED script activity into per-indicator Temporal activity orchestration.
- Added `listFredIndicatorsActivity` for active FRED indicator discovery and `loadFredIndicatorActivity` for one-indicator download/normalize/load execution.
- Added controlled workflow concurrency with a default of 3 and a hard cap of 10.
- Updated the manual Temporal FRED runner to support `--indicators=GDP,UNRATE` and `--concurrency=2`.
- Updated runner output to show structured per-indicator successes and failures.
- Kept the previous full-script FRED activity exported for compatibility while moving the active workflow to indicator-batch mode.
- Updated Temporal docs and README notes for the indicator-level workflow.

